    "body": "We want to implement eLabFTW at our university and need to take care of data privacy. The requested feature would be an optional additional page before the actual registration with the data privacy statement. Ideally, the following requirements are met:\r\n\r\n* activate optional data privacy statement from system admin panel, similar to enabling account creation \r\n* add a field where an individual data privacy statement can be entered, e.g. with markdown or html format\r\n* the privacy statement has to be explicitly approved, e.g. with a button press on a page before or via checking a box\r\n* after successful registration the data privacy statement is mailed to the user and preferably, has to be confirmed again upon confirming the mail adress (i.e. double opt-in)\r\n* add an optional additional link to the data privacy statement of the institution, a good position would be in the footer of the page where the links for admin pages are - currently, this can be achieved by exchanging the documentation link from the admin panel \r\n\r\nThanks",
